HOW TO COMPILE & RUN
gcc -O2 -o answer answer.c
taskset -c 0 ./answer
python3 plot.py

HOW TO COPY FILES TO AND FROM CSUG
scp ~/ameyaDB/sideQuest/security/"reverse cache"/answer.c ~/ameyaDB/sideQuest/security/"reverse cache"/plot.py amandhar@cycle1.csug.rochester.edu:~
scp 'amandhar@cycle1.csug.rochester.edu:~/*.png' 'amandhar@cycle1.csug.rochester.edu:~/*.csv' ~/Desktop/